[quote="Melkhor"]

I thought the last one sounded like a fun one as well, so I had a go at it too. Beat it in the first try with no heroes incapped (Fanatic was at 7, everyone else was at double digits). Turns out the cosmic harbinger of destruction from beyond the stars is a LOT less scary when he spends the entire fight thoroughly wrapped up in a hoist chain!

[/quote]

&nbsp;

How did the Hoist Chain help you against the double Scion of Flames (+1 dmg each)? &nbsp;Since none of the Scions go away (Advanced Progeny), by about Round 2-3, Progeny usually has about five Scions out, so by that point, the heroes are (ex:) taking +2 damage each time, having to discard a card the first time they hit Progeny every round, and having Progeny heal himself 4 HP the first time he&#39;s hit every round. &nbsp;&nbsp;

