Well, first of all, I did it on normal, since nothing was mentioned about Advanced mode and there&#39;s a wonderful counter to Scion of Flame in the form of Overdrive + Hoist Chain, or in case of two Scions of Flame, Overdrive + Rod of Anubis + Hoist Chain. If no Overdrive is readily available then Rod of Anubis + Embolden on Fixer also works wonders for his humble Hoist Chain.

Also, Progeny is generally fairly susceptible to deck control, so Astral Premonition is probably the most important card in Nightmist&#39;s deck to get out.

I think it should be doable as well on Advanced, though obviously considerably harder, and would probably take multiple attempts until you get really good starting hands for everyone.
